    {
      "key": "SingleModeScenarioRamen619008",
      "path": [
        "SingleModeScenarioRamen619008"
      ],
      "source_text": "由于拉面的品质相当不错，拉面嘉年华<color=#FF6D26>迎来了盛况</color>",
